        "message": "test(lcb201): register scale-matched PressureFlow idle-cost cohort\n\nPreregisters the #201 quiet-water discrimination before qualifying runs:\nfive #370-scale pool profiles (reference/cached/dormant plus FreeMass\ncontext) reusing the LCB-002 apparatus translation unit unchanged, three\nexisting small-scale LCB-002 profiles, a WSL2 platform check and one perf\nattribution run. Five mechanism/smoke diagnostic runs are recorded and\nexcluded from the registered summary.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
