      },
      {
        "message": "docs(lcb201): record PressureFlow idle-cost discrimination and Planned P1/P2\n\nRecords the registered #201 cohort on main 3da7e7be: 48 Windows and 4 WSL2\nchildren with full same-law parity every tick, perf attribution, and 34\nnative pressure regression tests. At #370 quiet-pool scale PF reference\ncosts 36-40 ms/tick of serial preparation; cached/dormant cut it to\n9-12 ms, leaving the sleeping-block wake scan; gas-input edits and moving\nmasks return them toward reference cost. Outcome B: two cached-only\nproposals (wake-summary elision, narrowed gas revocation) are Planned with\nproof obligations. No production source, default, host or CI change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "parents": [
          "69eef3f136e9f9cb327cfc973aaf594be69bdeb7"
        ],
        "sha": "d3d320db3686370848aed86cc6c36fdfe6ae77ce"
      },
      {
        "message": "docs(lcb201): apply independent review corrections\n\nRelabel historical ratios as execution1 beside execution3 and the c97f68ec\nrepeat; widen the reference range to 31-41 ms; separate the cold residual;\ndescribe the cyclic-shift order and cache-cold limits; cite draft #370 as\nconsistent-with; qualify the outcome label; complete P1/P2 proof\nobligations; correct a post-execution driver comment only.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
